# Kylox, Visionary Inventor: printed characteristics - a 4/4 blue-red legendary Lizard Artificer with menace and haste - and its
# attack trigger with no other creature. Turn 1 Bot1 casts Kylox with two Black Lotus and a Mox Ruby and attacks at once (haste).
# There is no other creature to sacrifice, so nothing is asked, X = 0 and nothing is exiled: the Lightning Bolt on top of
# Bot1's library stays there, and Kylox hits for 4.

[Bot1 Deck]
Black Lotus
Black Lotus
Mox Ruby
Kylox, Visionary Inventor
Plains x3
Lightning Bolt
Plains x5

[Bot2 Deck]
Island x10

[Actions]
[T1 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Hand.Mox Ruby.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Black Lotus.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Black Lotus.Cast
