? Bot1.Battlefield.Kylox, Visionary Inventor.Supertypes = Legendary
[T1 Bot1.DeclareAttackers]
Bot1.Attack(Kylox, Visionary Inventor > Bot2)
? Stack.Count = 1
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
